id: BUILD-039
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: advisory
title: Async Express route handler without error catching
category: build
severity: error
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .ts .js
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: async
patterns:
  - regex: (app|router)\.(get|post|put|delete|patch)\([^,]*,\s*async
    message: "Async Express route handler — Express 4 doesn't catch async rejections, unhandled promise kills the server"
fix: Wrap handler body in try/catch with next(error), use express-async-errors package, or upgrade to Express 5.
